WEBVTT

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.290
Data-collection... complete.

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:51.140
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:54.040
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:00:55.120 --> 00:01:01.040
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:05.040
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:11.760
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:16.040
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.960
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:24.880
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:27.680
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:31.440
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:36.440
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.610
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:42.150
Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:45.280
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:48.240
Warping dimensional space!

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:52.320
Dividing Driver!

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:59.960
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:05.840
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:08.790
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:12.680
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.750
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:17.090
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:20.000
Farewell, GGG

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.790
<i>Farewell, GGG</i>

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.910
Are you sure you're okay with this, Mic?

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:34.250
You haven't told Mamoru and the others you're going back to the US.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.180
I don't wanna make everybody worry, you know!

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:39.580
That's why I'm going home without telling them!

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:44.020
I mean, it really is sad. But I'm a boy, after all!

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:46.120
That's why... That's why...

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.660
Once all your repairs are done and you're feeling better...

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.130
...come back to see us, all right?

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.830
Oh! Mikoto! You're such a sweetheart!

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:55.700
I promise I'll come back one day!

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:07.250
Mic, it's almost time to go.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.370
Okay, gotcha!

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:12.680
There goes Uncle Liger, making his usual commotion...

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:13.550
You said it!

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:17.550
Everybody! Bye-bye! See you again! So long! Bye-bye!

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.420
Everybody, so long! Good-bye!

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:26.800
Stallion, give my regards to Mom and Dad.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:29.740
Okay. Swan, you take care of yourself, too.

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:47.210
So long, Mic.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:55.080
KITCHEN

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.900
Um, answer the following question.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.770
Read the passage underlined in red and summarize...

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:09.810
...what the author is trying to express in thirty words or less.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:11.400
Thanks for waiting, everyone!

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:15.010
All right, guys, time for lunch!

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:17.280
Yay, time to eat! Time to eat!

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:19.340
Waha! Looks good!

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.420
Let's eat!

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:25.780
Man, this food is awesome!

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.460
My, my, your table manners are pretty vulgar, no?

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:36.240
By the way, are you getting your summer vacation homework done?

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:38.970
My cousin Ayame says she'll give us a hand with it later!

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:40.100
Waha!

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:42.140
Hey, cool! That'll be a big help!

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:44.380
But I don't believe it!

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:49.380
Look what happened to Tokyo, and we still got a ton of homework!

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:50.420
So what?

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:53.550
You should be thankful that we all survived, for pete's sake!

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.890
That's right! We totally lucked out this time!

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:58.620
But...

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:01.560
What about Ikumi?

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:10.670
Poor Kaidou, wonder where he is now?

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:17.070
How's the recovery process coming along?

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:20.610
Well, externally, we're making good progress, but...

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.880
The problem is with their A.I. systems, right?

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:28.320
We've already done everything possible on our end.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:32.580
All we can do now is hope that their self-repair systems kick in.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:41.330
Just one more push, eh?

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:44.500
But they won't have to go into battle any time soon.

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:49.310
I only hope you're right about that.

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:49.930
Huh?

00:05:57.190 --> 00:06:03.280
I can see you're thinking about the Primevals from Galeon's message.

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:06.350
Yes...

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:11.970
Dr. Liger! My brothers are all doing well, aren't they?

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:13.470
Of course!

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:17.130
They all can't wait to see you in person, Mic.

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:20.100
Oh! Well, I can't wait to see them, either!

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:25.570
Dr. Liger! We need you at once in the cockpit. Please, hurry up!

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:26.510
Huh?

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:29.680
What in tarnation's going on?

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:30.380
Whoa!

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:43.160
What the heck is that?

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:46.060
The Gravity Field! I'm not detecting any changes!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.760
No anomalies in the earth's magnetic field!

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.600
It's unlikely that it's a metal substance!

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:53.270
There's an unstable pattern on the X line indicating a form of polymer!

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:55.210
Deuteron concentration on the rise!

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:59.180
Oh, my God! The magnetic field tube is...

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:00.680
O-Oh, no!

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:02.310
It's gonna attack us!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:15.860
What?

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:24.930
Yosef!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:33.480
Uh...

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:34.710
Um...

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:38.890
Ikumi!

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:48.430
Y-You're Kaidou's mom, aren't you?

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.330
Uh, yes.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:55.760
I'm in the same class as Kaidou. My name is Mamoru Amami.

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:58.410
Uh, um...

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:04.240
I really hope Kaidou comes home soon.

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:20.520
I'm sure that he's gone back to his real parents.

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:22.460
His real parents?

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:30.190
I'm so sorry.

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:31.900
Saying such things to you...

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:34.070
Mamoru...

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:37.710
I want to thank you for being so concerned about my Ikumi.

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:39.810
Goodbye...

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:44.650
Kaidou's... real...

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:07.270
Utsugi
Family
Grave

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.440
Father... Mother...

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:07.470
You've both been avenged by Gai.

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:16.250
Gai, thank you so much.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.790
I'm the one who should be thanking you.

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:20.220
Huh?

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.650
You're the reason...

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.360
All this time...

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:28.160
I've been able to go on fighting because of you.

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.730
So thanks, Mikoto.

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:37.200
Gai...

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:42.170
Listen, Gai...

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.580
Huh?

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:48.880
Wouldn't it be great if it stayed peaceful like this forever?

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:50.510
Yeah...

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:12.110
Gai!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.940
What the... what the heck is that?

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:58.080
What is that!

00:10:58.450 --> 00:10:59.980
No radar response.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.280
The satellite search isn't picking anything up either!

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.420
Deuterons, increased density!

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:06.720
I've detected a magnetic field tube!

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.190
It's going to attack us!

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:10.090
Is that object targeting...

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:11.830
...this Bay Tower Base?

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:14.400
I'm sorry I'm late!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:15.560
Where's Gai?

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:20.730
He's fusing with Galeon onboard the Triple-decked Flying Carrier.

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:26.170
GaiGar!

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:31.210
GaoMachines, emergency launch! Get a move on!

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:35.750
No!

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:39.120
Here it comes!

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:50.860
The Space Development Corporation!

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:52.030
Isamu!

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:54.870
Mamoru!

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:58.070
Did the Zonderians survive?

00:11:58.180 --> 00:12:00.810
GGG... Everybody's in danger!

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.050
Amphibious Armored Maintenance Vehicle has been destroyed!

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:13.220
The Gravity Tower's not going to hold!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.160
All GGG members are advised to evacuate!

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:17.060
Mobilize the Triple-decked Flying Carrier!

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:25.200
The Ultra-Technology Laboratory is sinking fast!

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:26.370
You've got to hurry!

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:28.570
All right! Final Fusion, approved!

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:31.830
Program Drive!

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:40.320
Gai!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.100
GaoGaiGar!

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:10.710
You guys!

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:12.750
King of Braves, GaoGaiGar...

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:16.120
You're the only hope left to mankind now!

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:20.020
Don't let them beat you, Gai!

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:21.960
Gai... we're counting on you!

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:25.600
I believe in you with all my heart, GaoGaiGar!

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:28.160
Don't ever give up, King of Braves!

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:32.100
My son, give it all you've got!

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:35.230
Gai...

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:37.680
Please...

00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:40.040
...pull off a miracle!

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:48.980
No!

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:50.220
It can't be!

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:51.790
GGG is...

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:53.160
...GGG is!

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:58.020
Broken Magnum!

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:08.100
Damn you! I'm not letting you get away with this!

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:16.480
Protect Shade!

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:19.680
GaoGaiGar!

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:34.760
It destroyed my Barrier!

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.000
Protect Shade!

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:57.320
Now I'm gonna finish you off!

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:02.220
Since I can't use the Goldion Hammer, the only thing I can do is...

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:03.790
I have no other choice!

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:07.130
Hell and Heaven!

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:12.560
Gemu, giru, gan, go, gufo...

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.310
GaoGaiGar!

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:54.340
No way! How could Hell and Heaven not work?

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:01.780
Damn! I'm not done yet!

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:27.810
I'm not gonna go down. I can't afford to lose!

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.210
For all my comrades who stood by me all this time...

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:33.410
For everyone I'm supposed to protect!

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:37.920
I'm going to show them my greatest weapon right now!

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:39.290
And it's called...

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.960
Courage

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:45.260
What the?

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:50.130
GaoGaiGar!

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.650
Big Brother Gai!

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:17.890
My...

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:20.090
My courage...

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:21.930
Will never die...

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:30.210
Now detecting the 31 Machine Primevals!

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:33.140
It is time for us to set sail.

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:34.540
Mobilize!

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:36.010
J-Ark!

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:56.020
His home has exploded in the destructive flames of war.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:56.020
Furusato wa horobi no senka ni chitta

00:17:56.140 --> 00:18:07.600
There's no planet for him to return to in this lonely galaxy.

00:17:56.140 --> 00:18:07.600
Kaeru hoshi ni naki kokou no ginga

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:07.410
Jewel Generator, fire on all cylinders!

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:08.870
Roger!

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:20.000
All of the warrior's sorrow and tears have long since dried.

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:20.000
Kanashimi mo namida mo karehateta senshi

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:32.540
His noble blood begins to roar.

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:32.540
Kedakaki chi wa hoeru tsubasa wo hirogete

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:27.100
Antimeson Cannons, all cannon bays open!

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:28.140
Roger!

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:32.370
Fire!

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:38.770
The ultimate battleship...

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:38.770
Choudokyuu senkan

00:18:38.770 --> 00:18:43.920
Soar away into the gorgeous sky.

00:18:38.770 --> 00:18:43.920
utsukushiki sora he habatake

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:43.880
What's that?

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:49.380
The ultimate battleship...

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:49.380
Choudokyuu senkan

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:47.280
Careful, or you're going to end up destroying the Primeval Core itself.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:50.460
True, my power did seem somewhat excessive.

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:54.970
The J-Jewel calls you

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:54.970
J-Jueru no michibiki ga

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:52.890
It is the curse left by Abel.

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:55.800
Absolute Danger Rate, 100.

00:18:54.970 --> 00:19:05.270
and will guide you.

00:18:54.970 --> 00:19:05.270
omae wo yondeiru

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:10.410
What is it? That white battleship?

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:12.410
Fusion!

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:19.340
J-Bird! Plug Out!

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:33.100
Mega-Fusion!

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:59.650
King J-Der!

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:11.600
5-Linked Maser Cannons!

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:30.050
Antimeson Cannons!

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:46.740
Amazing!

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:52.140
So strong... so huge... what an awesome robot!

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.750
Who in the world is he?

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:26.070
Unbelievable power!

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:30.150
J-Quath!

00:21:52.610 --> 00:21:54.300
J-Quath!

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:08.750
All 3 Primevals have been shot down.

00:22:09.060 --> 00:22:11.650
King J-Der...

00:22:14.360 --> 00:22:15.990
Who is this robot...

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:24.060
You're not getting away!

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:26.470
Wait!

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:29.570
We don't want the Primeval Cores to regenerate.

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:30.970
I've got to Purify them first!

00:22:33.280 --> 00:22:34.300
It can't be!

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:50.350
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:55.220
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.620 --> 00:23:01.400
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:06.190
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:10.360
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:17.290
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.350 --> 00:23:24.050
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:28.710
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:34.050
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:40.950
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.950 --> 00:23:48.850
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:52.520
The boy Kaidou who appeared from inside the giant white battleship...

00:23:52.590 --> 00:23:54.250
...what is his story?

00:23:54.900 --> 00:23:56.950
Now that mankind has lost GGG...

00:23:57.030 --> 00:24:01.230
...it is time for the 13-robot Mic Sounders Brigade and Disc X to launch!

00:24:01.800 --> 00:24:04.100
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:04.170 --> 00:24:06.800
"The 31 Machine Primevals Strike Back!"

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:06.440
The 31 Machine Primevals Strike Back!

00:24:06.870 --> 00:24:10.140
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.150 --> 00:24:14.880
All Mic Models

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:14.780
This is the Key to Victory!
